  'Defeat your first Onslaught boss': ['Besiege deinen ersten Onslaught-Boss','Derrota a tu primer jefe de Onslaught','Победите первого босса Onslaught','击败首个 Onslaught 首领','Derrote seu primeiro chefe de Onslaught','Onslaught 첫 보스 처치','Onslaughtで最初のボスを撃破'],
